      "bpm": 155.0,
      "composer": "Shane Ivers",
      "copyright_holder": "Shane Ivers",
      "description": "80s Motivational Chiptune channels the specific optimism of arcade gaming at its peak – that particular brand of conviction that convinced an entire generation of children that digital worlds could be conquered with sufficient persistence and a well-aimed joystick. The bassline marches through circuits of possibility with relentless enthusiasm, chiptune melodies bounce across the frequency range with the brightness and determination of music that has absolute faith in the player’s ability to succeed, and the whole thing drives forward with the kind of focused energy that makes difficult things feel achievable. It is motivation in its most direct and pixelated form, and it works.",
